<title>SWITZERLAND: Usego sales rise 1.4 pct in first half.</title>
<headline>Usego sales rise 1.4 pct in first half.</headline>
<dateline>VOLKETSWIL, Switzerland 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss food company Usego Hofer Curti said consolidated sales rose 1.4 percent in the first half of 1997 to 916 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>It said in a statement all units contributed to the turnover increase. It gave no profit figures.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
